From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:19:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: OnePlus 8 Pro voice calls

Add the voice call patches (0117-0137): Q6Voice with the PCIe mailbox for
the external SDX55, QRTR forwarding between the modem and the ADSP with
working flow control, the MHI satellite driver, vocproc topology
parameters and a switch and volume control for the TFA987x amplifiers
(the top speaker is the earpiece).

Enable SND_SOC_QDSP6_Q6VOICE, SND_SOC_QDSP6_Q6VOICE_DAI and
MHI_BUS_SATELLITE.
