+Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:55:17 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 118/137] WIP: ASoC: qcom: qdsp6: Add Q6Voice with PCIe mailbox
+ support
+
+Import the Q6Voice driver (MVM/CVS/CVP) by Stephan Gerhold from the
+msm8916-mainline tree and extend it for SM8250 with an external SDX55:
+
+- configurable passive MVM session name
+- VSS_IPKTEXG_CMD_SET_MAILBOX_MEMORY_CONFIG with the mailbox address as
+  seen by the ADSP and by PCIe, and an MHI vote while a call runs
+- codec DMA TX ports as voice capture sources
+
+Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
+(cherry picked from commit 5b8fe93b3bf9a68aa2971e808c2936bee5814627)
