index 0000000000..89c7949f3b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/device/testing/linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/0127-WIP-ASoC-qcom-q6voice-dai-Start-AUDIO_VOICE_0-during.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,55 @@
+From d753c248d9cef84ba24bd5f8ea9e2cfa54a16844 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 21:30:17 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 127/137] WIP: ASoC: qcom: q6voice-dai: Start AUDIO_VOICE_0
+ during calls
+
+Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
+(cherry picked from commit e43b639a580a7a3ccb38aaa98b10c95b0f9c3bce)
+---
